PresentationLayer -down-> DomainLayer : depends on
DataLayer .up.|> DomainLayer : implements
DataLayer -right-> DomainLayer : uses models

note bottom of DomainLayer
  Pure logic, no Android dependencies.
  Contains business rules and entities.
end note

